---
import "../../styles/admin-static.css";
import worksData from "../../data/works.json";
import modelsData from "../../data/models.json";

const works = worksData;
const models = modelsData;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>静的admin | 光景ノオト</title>
  </head>
  <body class="admin-static-body">
    <main class="admin-static-shell">
      <nav class="admin-static-nav" aria-label="静的adminナビゲーション">
        <a class="admin-static-title" href="/admin-static/">光景ノオト 静的admin</a>
        <div class="admin-static-links">
          <a class="is-active" href="/admin-static/">Top</a>
          <a href="/admin-static/works/">Works</a>
          <a href="/admin-static/models/">Models</a>
          <a href="/admin-static/register/">Register Preview</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <header class="admin-static-header">
        <h1>静的admin</h1>
        <p>GitHub Pages上で安全に開ける、閲覧・入力確認専用の管理画面です。</p>
      </header>

      <p class="admin-static-notice">
        現在はプレビュー専用です。保存、画像変換、JSON更新、GitHub認証、GitHub API連携は行いません。
      </p>

      <section class="admin-static-grid" aria-label="概要">
        <a class="admin-static-card" href="/admin-static/works/">
          <span>Works</span>
          <strong>{works.length}作品</strong>
          <small>作品一覧を開く</small>
        </a>
        <a class="admin-static-card" href="/admin-static/models/">
          <span>Models</span>
          <strong>{models.length}モデル</strong>
          <small>モデル一覧を開く</small>
        </a>
        <a class="admin-static-card" href="/admin-static/register/">
          <span>Preview</span>
          <strong>保存なし作品登録</strong>
          <small>iPhone入力体験を確認する</small>
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
